          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "దండోరా — daṇḍōrā — \"a drum proclamation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "గ్రామంలో ఒక దండోరా వినిపించింది. grāmaṁlō oka daṇḍōrā vinipiñcindi. A drum proclamation was heard in the village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "దండోరా (daṇḍōrā) వేయు, to proclaim with a drum: the old way to spread news through the whole ఊరు."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "దండోరా (daṇḍōrā) is an old word for news cried with a drum through the streets; its origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
